<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>Welcome to Mazadak</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6;'
  >
    <div
      style='max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px;'
    >
      <h2 style='color: #28a745;'>Account Successfully Verified! 🎉</h2>
      <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Welcome to <strong>Mazadak</strong>! Your email address has been verified successfully, and your account is now fully active.</p>

      <div
        style='background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: left;'
      >
        <p style='margin: 5px 0;'>You can now:</p>
        <ul style='margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;'>
          <li>Browse and participate in live auctions.</li>
          <li>Place bids and track your favorite items.</li>
          <li>Create and list your own auctions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a
        href='{{frontendUrl}}'
        style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #28a745; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 15px 0; font-weight: bold;'
      >
        Explore Mazadak Now
      </a>

      <p style='font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 30px;'>If you have any questions or need support, feel free to reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
